data: {"id": "cf3d95fa405b496a-thinking-layer-431", "run_id": "cf3d95fa405b496a", "node": "layer", "node_name": "问题定位", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "当前集群存在 1 个异常 Pod。该 Pod 处于 `ContainerCreating` 状态，未能进入 `Running` 状态。根据状态特征，这可能由镜像拉取失败（ImagePullFailed）、卷挂载失败（VolumeMountFailed）或 Sandbox 创建失败引起。\n\n**异常组定义：**\n*   **异常组 1**: 镜像/容器运行时异常 (涉及 Pod: `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz`)\n\n我将获取 `pod-imagepull-failed.md` 和 `pod-volume-mount-failed.md` 作为辅助诊断手册，因为 `ContainerCreating` 状态通常对应这两类问题。\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 4, "ts_ms": 1788768936049}

