data: {"id": "cf3d95fa405b496a-thinking-parallel_evidence-1180", "run_id": "cf3d95fa405b496a", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "# 证据结论\n\n## 实体身份\n- **Pod**: `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz`\n- **UID**: `86b6a1bf-eb40-431d-bfb5-00fe85ed2475`\n- **Node**: `node2`\n- **Phase**: `Pending`\n- **Container**: `app`，镜像 `xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine`，`imagePullPolicy=IfNotPresent`\n\n## 支持候选原因的事实\n1. **VolumeMountFailed（根因已明确）**：\n   - **Events**: `MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found`（11次重复，持续7分26秒）\n   - **Events**: `Unable to attach or mount volumes: unmoun", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788768974029, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

